	(text "Robot detection (firmware): with Q8001 off, PROBE_DRV high drives ~13 uA into DOCK+.\nR_robot = V(DOCK+) / ((3.3 V - V(PROBE_A)) / 100k - V(DOCK+) / 1.1M); the diode drop cancels.\nv1 robot signature: ~130k (R175 + R7305 || 1.1M sense divider) and ~30 uF (settles in ~2 s).\nEnergize only after a stable reading inside the window; check VIN < 22 V first."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f9295850-5ae8-4f2d-a13c-0d50987d66ab")
	)
	(text "Q8001 soft start: R8004/R8005 set Vgs = -10 V, C8008 (Miller) ramps DOCK+ ~30 V/ms\n(~0.5 A inrush into the robot input caps); turn-off ~3 ms.\nCurrent: I_SENSE = 1 V/A (50 mOhm x 20), 3.3 A full scale. Turn off when it drops to ~0\n(robot left) or on overcurrent (ADC analog watchdog). Route INA180 IN-/IN+ Kelvin to R8007."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 127 147.32 0)
